Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 10:56:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(entities): animate numeric looping Bedrock bones

Read direct animations selected by unconditional entity scripts and apply numeric position and rotation keyframes to custom entity model parts. Sample from the entity render age so poses interpolate between ticks and reset before each draw. Leave Molang, animation controllers, and other unsupported channels untouched until their state can be evaluated correctly.
